  "description": "Distributed atomic-coordination primitives for .NET: IReplayGuard (single-use claim / nonce protection) and IRequestThrottle (atomic fixed-window rate limiting) over a pluggable backend, with a built-in in-memory default. Standalone and dependency-light (Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions only) — add Cirreum.Coordination.Redis for distributed, multi-instance coordination. Useful for replay/nonce protection, idempotency keys, message de-duplication, and rate limiting.",
